#: scenario3:scenario3_88E8A41E_A9B3_4AD5_BB26_E648A814EDB1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8cdef90123a0cc187204567ef8d4a407b3bc7671b9fb951e1c63aab0e18e6b17
#. default-sha256: d7cb9fc3b8e93ccfcf62751cf96e39ab41d3cf408d8efafe779ec30172c3803b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_88E8A41E_A9B3_4AD5_BB26_E648A814EDB1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫…………."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A4D825DA_EBE9_49C2_91AB_B085D9CB8EA5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9d4837d2d4392e7cb23e934f32b0b7310ae62b068d8e6f7c0a2ab9c4831478f0
#. default-sha256: d37228223e2dba46e89afbff236c1455e1a9b02002cd7c7e6ea90d2cbaf43747
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A4D825DA_EBE9_49C2_91AB_B085D9CB8EA5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Looking down dejectedly at the undrunken tea, the White-Haired Girl walked alone down the "
"corridor."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫백발 소녀는 ⟪k:1⟫아무도 마시지 않은 홍차를 서글프게 바라보며, ⟪k:2⟫홀로 ⟪k:3⟫복도를 걸어갔습"
"니다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F7BCD182_8814_4357_9D96_A99E95E4FC85
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c96846ffc2b09b26b0a0ed7c53a555d083dec4060c9f3ccd945eeb3222f716bd
#. default-sha256: 3f4a57c55a249b3fcc43b9610bc00172800893db2cba6200af80422bd6bcc364
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F7BCD182_8814_4357_9D96_A99E95E4FC85"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though its calming scent filled the air, there was nobody around to have their heart warmed "
"by it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫마음을 진정시키는 향기가 주위에 감돌아도, ⟪k:1⟫그 향에 편안한 미소를 짓는 이는 ⟪k:2⟫누구도 없"
"었지요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_8B9C3D09_7F27_4EB1_A73D_A37B088B6E26
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7ac5864aa4653004e00ab81ec2caa87fc8cfbb5bf758aeaf291537fbdab0e8d0
#. default-sha256: a2443d1ead0d61ddfc5c86e2945021c4a84a7804cb070fb1b2b0ce79512c98fb
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_8B9C3D09_7F27_4EB1_A73D_A37B088B6E26"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Nor was there anyone to alleviate her loneliness."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫소녀의 고독을 달래는 이도요……."

#: scenario3:scenario3_773BF3F5_3E27_413D_B02F_76AAC10204C2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0bdcdda4ac6a222117f5943ab17a1794f1972ed22efb98eee0d8dad7086c25ff
#. default-sha256: 5bc9b3cd7e94339496d9306117901dc57eb5f22a645633bb474b3ca75b2525c0
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_773BF3F5_3E27_413D_B02F_76AAC10204C2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Despite being the master’s wife, the maids who crossed her path in the halls said nary a "
"word to her."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫복도를 오가는 메이드들은 ⟪k:1⟫이 저택의 마님이 보여도 ⟪k:2⟫말 한마디 걸지 않았습니다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_B9F11270_C774_4CE1_82C9_98BFE4C943F9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c00d2646793359e5a0dc9b5f0b9ce524254c5cb9875aa4abefbf8152ccbfcc6d
#. default-sha256: 31b54adc12e8b28c98d65600e59c1d439b16301d3d9228e49b6b12fab27675af
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B9F11270_C774_4CE1_82C9_98BFE4C943F9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D1CC945B_1426_486D_A007_7D0E685D60C7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 446b484902c94d86d99d60bbd648c229128b2022cdc13f5da0d6e6c76e563672
#. default-sha256: 20d5a8aa250994b88001ac8bd00846fa75b8dcd6ce95ee2f8a0e03da4b653ec2
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D1CC945B_1426_486D_A007_7D0E685D60C7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫As a matter of fact—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫심지어는⟪k:1⟫―――"

#: scenario3:scenario3_2648BE34_8454_4A6E_A4B9_1544D81DC629
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ecdb7cdf718613534e3118053228b5ded35f5326e6a69bf9ef43f43a491891ff
#. default-sha256: 3e4feb502cf46ce563cce778edc66aa3e48dc29b843fa004a7ba2b973a6aaee6
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_2648BE34_8454_4A6E_A4B9_1544D81DC629"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫...!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫…………앗!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_3FDDECF2_46DB_4622_9B83_A8AD0DCF0D84
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 08d693600a4b1ad581e01669667e01d7de9e96617d781382e9c676425b1f83e6
#. default-sha256: 670bff5381c72879ba40bcbbce33ea5dff7ffa9f0c1ed7dfefaa4f89b4e4d8a1
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_3FDDECF2_46DB_4622_9B83_A8AD0DCF0D84"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Oh dear.⟪k:8⟫I beg your pardon, Madam."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫어머나, ⟪k:8⟫죄송하네요, 마님?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_B4165425_8A41_45A9_87B1_4540C8B167C8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 580139f7eee10b16af7e76597507798e6b1a8d9dc922e96cbfc195017e2593d0
#. default-sha256: 9d38c55c89a1f114aa88d799caf8a93403242521dc06429ce951ca98f1302131
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B4165425_8A41_45A9_87B1_4540C8B167C8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Ah... ⟪k:1⟫it’s fine..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫아……, ⟪k:1⟫괜찮아요………."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9747367B_ECC6_47EA_B0E3_2CB573183AC4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c207194baec925621fd2d394f3abfaec056503c919b639c066547aa40a0de2b4
#. default-sha256: 615edd9f13fd5949ac153a5cf9e9370e07e60cd9bb3e96a5a0cb07a47f412adf
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9747367B_ECC6_47EA_B0E3_2CB573183AC4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫—one even bumped into her, stifling a laugh as she trotted off."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫소녀에게 부딪혀 놓고 ⟪k:1⟫실실 웃으며 ⟪k:2⟫지나가는 메이드도 있었답니다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_CD736832_7BEC_4174_A5C4_33B2132F2C71
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c0c5626482ab76a9d355491749ab61466aefd1c002d9cd0fe3527b4564f74974
#. default-sha256: 730e08a423a67b02ebbfeef0ce075832a61224dd50e6e40447bdc73669592c02
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_CD736832_7BEC_4174_A5C4_33B2132F2C71"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫In all likelihood, she had done it intentionally. ⟪k:1⟫The poor White-Haired Girl, who had "
"fallen to the floor, stared helplessly at the broken cups."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫보나마나 ⟪k:1⟫일부러 한 걸 겁니다. ⟪k:2⟫딱하게도 ⟪k:3⟫넘어진 백발 소녀는 ⟪k:4⟫깨진 식기를 막"
"막하게 바라보았습니다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_755AD335_1E15_49D6_A108_2117706A1AC7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2a273023698efb248ace32cd4c8a95db7b59726446aa8298f25815d97dbbf7b4
#. default-sha256: 9c2b94c6842ef66c9689edd8cade3d99cfa661a6b333d3a6ea5f46733db6f1d0
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_755AD335_1E15_49D6_A108_2117706A1AC7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The tea she had made for her husband was forming a stain in the carpet."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫정성을 들여 ⟪k:1⟫남편을 위해 준비한 홍차도 ⟪k:2⟫카펫의 얼룩이 될 뿐."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D9217328_537E_44AE_A7D1_F2142D1419F2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0bbd5e74d4b2b6ee509fca77a31342dc6c7e010f9e3966e1d79ce04f7221473e
#. default-sha256: 85dbd7ca63d05914db815311d58758bca7254c4e8583e235da353b5d34e8bf12
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D9217328_537E_44AE_A7D1_F2142D1419F2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The maids’ behavior toward the mistress of the house was absolutely unacceptable."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫메이드가 이러한 짓을 ⟪k:1⟫주인 마님에게 하다니, ⟪k:2⟫당치도 않은 짓이지요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_FCE0642B_DBE2_4935_A25D_FAE1492D1023
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 933239ed2eae4e78641b6dc1fbce58429730ef7364e485242fa7e66b42b89bec
#. default-sha256: d455b29818cdb9a0f219129f0cfbf628ef84593ed82d2edca9fdc03f5b622d19
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_FCE0642B_DBE2_4935_A25D_FAE1492D1023"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nonetheless, it was commonplace—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫all because of the way Jacopo treated her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫하지만 ⟪k:1⟫이 저택에선 누구도 뭐라 하지 않았습니다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫이 또한 ⟪k:4⟫야코포의 태도가 문"
"제였지요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D68D42FA_CF32_457E_9CB5_30FBC93EEFC8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eb3b9790576f002c0694e51c8707e134a55b04cbdce8c65b179110ddaa8ca6a6
#. default-sha256: fd4f2eac603ed9604c6d41d136b9a341351dc5bc347a661cea36e33e9e874471
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D68D42FA_CF32_457E_9CB5_30FBC93EEFC8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The more the man of the house acted cruel to her,⟪k:1⟫the less weight her position as his "
"wife held to the servants."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫저택의 주인이 아내를 홀대하다 보니, ⟪k:1⟫아내의 입지도 점점 안 좋아진 겁니다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_1855FFDE_01E4_46FF_B383_E9128B81C961
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8daa3365a35a99e7d71b2840720de4a8812b183fe26a02a9218f3eff4292f428
#. default-sha256: 22e51f7864fb87c28e4874b85a3cca91e704b207706d83ed3b6695ad09560a88
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_1855FFDE_01E4_46FF_B383_E9128B81C961"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Day in and day out, the maids worked busily—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫offered little opportunity for leisure—"
"⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫so they would naturally have accumulated quite a bit of stress."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫메이드들도 ⟪k:1⟫오락 없이 바쁜 나날을 보내긴 하므로, ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫스트레스가 쌓이긴 할 겁니다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_93CD596B_710F_4B6D_A9BE_C45CAFB41920
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 02d706d1562b2c939ecf39308032a54138bbda8b896edc3d22b97be9c89bc5a2
#. default-sha256: 1258537a575441f7dd3e0643f8f43e41f00bd688c431d562faa8fb445a7325c1
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_93CD596B_710F_4B6D_A9BE_C45CAFB41920"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And she became the target for them to let off this steam."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그런데 그걸 ⟪k:1⟫하필 소녀에게 발산한 것이지요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A6A74DB4_B6EB_4691_8E51_D0B71446E496
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3d46f6ae7c260bf4e887747e2fd257ce18c621c4a5767ff459c9fe164853f5d1
#. default-sha256: f11e7bfd244d9959fb2840b35dcd4a8d6a358d0e58ea85d797ba707ecbaae9ea
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A6A74DB4_B6EB_4691_8E51_D0B71446E496"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Not directly, but through a more subdued kind of harassment from the shadows."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫직접적인 수단 대신, ⟪k:1⟫보셨다시피 ⟪k:2⟫음습하게 굴면서요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C90492EF_7D04_424F_9879_017BF694F1CA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 10c9876d653944c8ee88f60d780ba4eb65563bb829249f2d9bfc26ef92609e80
#. default-sha256: 4be84efbbd9de46d4837ce5045210f7107b3d1a1447619f9ea8a5d464c7dfb10
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C90492EF_7D04_424F_9879_017BF694F1CA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She must have felt quite miserable. ⟪k:1⟫I imagine she would have been better off as one of "
"the maids."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫소녀 입장에선 ⟪k:1⟫비참한 심정이었을 겁니다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫차라리 ⟪k:4⟫같은 메이드인 게 ⟪k:5⟫나았"
"을 수도 있습니다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_FB205E25_E6F8_4865_B3E7_3319368D8FCC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 02bd2998d67f2b88256e81f63b4ed9f2412bd9cee7413a979b79f5fae85ab7fb
#. default-sha256: 7fd703934cc97be4e1533bfdadb53b38bf141f9368532ad33acef7d1bc3aee23
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_FB205E25_E6F8_4865_B3E7_3319368D8FCC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫On the surface, and in front of others, they showed respect for her as Jacopo’s bride. But "
"behind closed doors, they acted very much the opposite."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫대외적, ⟪k:1⟫남들 앞에선 야코포의 아내로 정중히 대우하면서――, ⟪k:2⟫아닐 때는 이런 처사."

#: scenario3:scenario3_E95184CC_AC3F_4BCB_A653_912ADADA02DF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ae177ab4ec234b7f32af08c0ce4d00bb485a7b41fbfbebe78cb906eb4b367fbb
#. default-sha256: 36e23a85495b127fb85d0195741ba88d83ba117fcf90c96312cbad6f652b1ba6
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_E95184CC_AC3F_4BCB_A653_912ADADA02DF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The disparity between the treatment she received around others—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫the treatment she "
"was ⟪k:3⟫supposed⟪k:4⟫ to receive at all times—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫and the way she was actually treated "
"made the abuse that much worse."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫마땅히 그래야 할 대외적 태도와 ⟪k:1⟫실제로 보이는 음습한 태도.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫그 대비가 ⟪k:4⟫소녀"
"를 더욱 괴롭게 했습니다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_267EE02A_941F_4448_8B47_CA74E017EE6D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1c4eba8b796db65de55813ee87a87709a3ba2a13019a46245c685bdf53edcae6
#. default-sha256: 53fecd205f3ffb756f05ba4abb7907d02b4b7885710c8c55f37227f27ee766ae
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_267EE02A_941F_4448_8B47_CA74E017EE6D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And furthermore, as you have seen through the other doors, Master, she was a very reserved "
"young woman."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫또한 ⟪k:1⟫소녀는 주인님께서 보시다시피 ⟪k:2⟫매우 내향적인 사람이었지요. ⟪k:3⟫소리 내어 ⟪k:4⟫"
"메이드들을 비난하지도 못 했고――"

#: scenario3:scenario3_9BDAD077_9CE6_4C39_8E22_6ABFFEE3ECF1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f5286f1e53b270fd1eac3df6a0bcaea3234fc8426b6e58ec4c8d5797c307cf67
#. default-sha256: 13625013678d4743f5904bf395eda36c55971f4e548c13366ec82ed9f531d14d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9BDAD077_9CE6_4C39_8E22_6ABFFEE3ECF1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She could neither raise her voice in reprimand nor raise her hand in retaliation."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫메이드들에게 ⟪k:1⟫반항하는 태도도 ⟪k:2⟫드러내질 못 했습니다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_2D2FF13F_3EAF_4424_8601_4E4DA6F69371
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 56b0b8c7ad3ceef70a464728bbc8e2f3b8e2742fddac057c8fa857d549d02d10
#. default-sha256: ed6e89c32f3b0642358fb84cb3eb5c390b3e4da2b7e2094d22098ab30517eb6d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_2D2FF13F_3EAF_4424_8601_4E4DA6F69371"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I have to get this cleaned up..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……치워야지……."

